"""What the atlas says that the source does not: the package blurbs, the descriptions that replace a
missing or overlong docstring, and the request tour. Everything else comes from the docstrings.

Keys are repository-relative paths (`path::Class` for a class). build.py fails when a key names something that no
longer exists, so a rename shows up here instead of as a silently wrong page."""

